# Previous MSF error: Captopril_cat had C8 skeleton (missing one C/N ring
# atom) instead of correct C8N2O3SH15. Valsartan_ani had charge=-2 instead
# of -1, causing RDKit to generate 2 fewer H atoms.
# Both caused catastrophic pKa_calc values (~2× normal ΔG).

